 plans and specs, the code review notes, the multi-backend idea doc, and the Codex plugin manifest.\n- Host profile moves to `~/.config/delegate/` with the `DELEGATE_HOST_PROFILE` override; profile fields `promptPreamble`, `verifyCommands`, `requiredDeny`, `deadlineMs` are gone.\n- Status records live in `$TMPDIR/delegate-jobs/`.\n- Setup builds the release binary, installs `delegate` on PATH, and moves an existing old profile to the new location.\n- The Claude plugin is renamed to `delegate` and ships only the skill. Version 1.0.0. README rewritten for the CLI.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] No MCP code or old-name references remain outside git history.\n- [ ] Setup on this machine installs `delegate` on PATH and moves the old profile.\n- [ ] All tests, clippy and the format check pass.\n\n## Blocked by\n\n- #12 Latency and supervisor-memory budgets\n","stderr":"","executionTime":1431,"interleavedOutput":"title:\tContract: remove MCP and rename to delegate\nstate:\tOPEN\nauthor:\tuser (Amogh Akshintala)\nlabels:\tready-for-agent\ncomments:\t1\nassignees:\t\nprojects:\t\nmilestone:\t\nissue-type:\t\nparent:\t\nsub-issues:\t\nsub-issues-completed:\t\nblocked-by:\tuser/delegate#12\nblocking:\tuser/delegate#15, user/delegate#14\nnumber:\t13\n--\n## Parent\n\n#4\n\n## What to build\n\nThe contract step: the CLI is the only interface, under the name `delegate`.\n\n- Remove the MCP server and everything only it used: the protocol loop, tool schemas, progress notifications, argument validation, the in-memory job registry, the old binary.\n- Remove the parity snapshot, the old reproduction spec, the July/August plans and specs, the code review notes, the multi-backend idea doc, and the Codex plugin manifest.\n- Host profile moves to `~/.config/delegate/` with the `DELEGATE_HOST_PROFILE` override; profile fields `promptPreamble`, `verifyCommands`, `requiredDeny`, `deadlineMs` are gone.\n- Status records live in `$TMPDIR/delegate-jobs/`.\n- Setup builds the release binary, installs `delegate` on PATH, and moves an existing old profile to the new location.\n- The Claude plugin is renamed to `delegate` and ships only the skill. Version 1.0.0. README rewritten for the CLI.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] No MCP code or old-name references remain outside git history.\n- [ ] Setup on this machine installs `delegate` on PATH and moves the old profile.\n- [ ] All tests, clippy and the format check pass.\n\n## Blocked by\n\n- #12 Latency and supervisor-memory budgets\n","localExecutionTimeMs":1229},"isBackground":false},"description":"View full issue #13 body"},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"tool_8a1c2dd5-debf-4127-bbcd-8469f1fc627","startedAtMs":"1790852402890","completedAtMs":"1790852404454"},"model_call_id":"23978e36-7eb7-44ac-8d86-987b657a4703-1-i46o","session_id":"e2d994f1-ef61-48a1-b218-cde928b7cc82","timestamp_ms":1790852404399}
