{"type":"assistant","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Commit:** `48493ce53942a8151bff37e45427250acf542766`  \n**vs `origin/main`:** 42 files changed, 1089 insertions(+), 12186 deletions(-)\n\n**Tests:** `cargo test` — lib **132**, `budgets` **6**, `cli_e2e` **27**, `cli_info_e2e` **5** (170 total). `cargo fmt --check` and `cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings` clean.\n\n**Deleted (source/tests):** `src/index.rs`, `src/index/tests.rs`, `src/main.rs`, `src/job_registry.rs`, `src/job_registry/tests.rs`, `src/runner.rs`, `src/runner/tests.rs`, `src/tool_schemas.rs`, `src/progress.rs`, `src/validate.rs`, `src/isolation.rs`, `src/safety.rs`, `tests/e2e.rs`, `tests/live.rs`\n\n**Deleted (docs/parity):** `spec.md`, `CODE-REVIEW.md`, `parity/` (3 files), `docs/superpowers/` (9 files), `docs/ideas/multi-backend.md`\n\n**Added:** `src/job.rs`, `src/job/tests.rs` (single-job supervisor; 19 registry tests kept)\n\n**E2E assertion changes:** none in `tests/cli_e2e.rs`, `tests/cli_info_e2e.rs`, or `tests/budgets.rs`.\n\n**Friction**\n- `job_registry` tests were large; keeping behavior meant a hand-curated `job/tests.rs` rather than mechanical deletion.\n- `include!(\"job/tests.rs\")` cannot use `//!` module docs (E0753); easy to miss.\n- `tests/live.rs` depended on `CARGO_BIN_EXE_cursor-delegate-mcp`; removed with MCP (not named in the delete list).\n\nSTATUS: DONE"}]},"session_id":"e2d994f1-ef61-48a1-b218-cde928b7cc82"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","duration_ms":339948,"duration_api_ms":339948,"is_error":false,"result":"Implementing Part A of issue #13: gathering issue details and exploring the codebase.\n\n\nImplementing systematically: creating the core `job` module and updating dependencies.\n\n\n**Commit:** `48493ce53942a8151bff37e45427250acf542766`  \n**vs `origin/main`:** 42 files changed, 1089 insertions(+), 12186 deletions(-)\n\n**Tests:** `cargo test` — lib **132**, `budgets` **6**, `cli_e2e` **27**, `cli_info_e2e` **5** (170 total). `cargo fmt --check` and `cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings` clean.\n\n**Deleted (source/tests):** `src/index.rs`, `src/index/tests.rs`, `src/main.rs`, `src/job_registry.rs`, `src/job_registry/tests.rs`, `src/runner.rs`, `src/runner/tests.rs`, `src/tool_schemas.rs`, `src/progress.rs`, `src/validate.rs`, `src/isolation.rs`, `src/safety.rs`, `tests/e2e.rs`, `tests/live.rs`\n\n**Deleted (docs/parity):** `spec.md`, `CODE-REVIEW.md`, `parity/` (3 files), `docs/superpowers/` (9 files), `docs/ideas/multi-backend.md`\n\n**Added:** `src/job.rs`, `src/job/tests.rs` (single-job supervisor; 19 registry tests kept)\n\n**E2E assertion changes:** none in `tests/cli_e2e.rs`, `tests/cli_info_e2e.rs`, or `tests/budgets.rs`.\n\n**Friction**\n- `job_registry` tests were large; keeping behavior meant a hand-curated `job/tests.rs` rather than mechanical deletion.\n- `include!(\"job/tests.rs\")` cannot use `//!` module docs (E0753); easy to miss.\n- `tests/live.rs` depended on `CARGO_BIN_EXE_cursor-delegate-mcp`; removed with MCP (not named in the delete list).\n\nSTATUS: DONE","session_id":"e2d994f1-ef61-48a1-b218-cde928b7cc82","request_id":"23978e36-7eb7-44ac-8d86-987b657a4703","usage":{"inputTokens":97562,"outputTokens":28330,"cacheReadTokens":3091675,"cacheWriteTokens":0}}
